| **Medium** | Finding 2 | `default_biquadratic_coeffs` returns `None` for all cooling types — cooling defaults live in `ac_config.rs` via a separate code path. |
| **Medium** | Finding 3 | Clarification that ARI rated cooling uses 19.44°C WB (not 26.7°C WB) as the biquadratic x1 variable; all HARES code uses the correct WB for cooling and DB for heating. |
| **Low** | Finding 4 | All stored coefficients match OCHRE sources exactly (verified row-by-row). Only single-speed pairs are provided — multi-speed equipment reuses the same pair. |
